From: iimmyy <i.a.martins001@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 22:27:09 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 16/41] ggml-hexagon v68: vectorized q8_K/q8_0 input quantizers
 (bit-exact vs the CPU, integer rounding), per-batch input-cache reset,
 LG_HEX_NO_Q2K/NO_Q4/F16_CPU switches

---
 ggml/src/ggml-hexagon/ggml-hexagon.cpp |   9 +-
 ggml/src/ggml-hexagon/htp/lg-q2k-ops.c | 165 +++++++++++++++++++------
 ggml/src/ggml-hexagon/htp/main.c       |   4 +-
 3 files changed, 138 insertions(+), 40 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-hexagon/ggml-hexagon.cpp b/ggml/src/ggml-hexagon/ggml-hexagon.cpp
index fd53fc4..d08caf4 100644
--- a/ggml/src/ggml-hexagon/ggml-hexagon.cpp
+++ b/ggml/src/ggml-hexagon/ggml-hexagon.cpp
@@ -2803,7 +2803,7 @@ static bool ggml_hexagon_supported_mul_mat(const struct ggml_hexagon_session * s
 
